      "four live Figma-derived product themes: Cream, Graphite, Purple Night and Retro",
      "27 exact textless Figma Main Menu component variants for Default/Hover/Selected states",
      "runtime trainer badge sheet instead of visual badge placeholders",
      "bundled canonical Inter and Pixelify Sans static faces with explicit theme-aware weights",
      "native starter DexEntry state presented through the KRS Pokédex DATA frame and active Pokémon-art provider",
      "global semantic Colorblind palette resolution from the Core accessibility profile",
      "device-aware contextual footer",
      "inline mod options and Info & Permissions panel",
      "versioned third-party feature trees presented under their Installed Mods card",
      "two independent theme-aware utility overlays with F8 visibility, F9 scope selection and explicit layout adjustment",
